				<r3d:description language="eng">&lt;&lt;&lt;!!!&lt;&lt;&lt; All user content from this site has been deleted. Visit SeedMeLab (https://seedmelab.org/) project as a new option for data hosting. &gt;&gt;&gt;!!!&gt;&gt;&gt; 
SeedMe is a result of a decade of onerous experience in preparing and sharing visualization results from supercomputing simulations with many researchers at different geographic locations using different operating systems. It’s been a labor–intensive process, unsupported by useful tools and procedures for sharing information. SeedMe provides a secure and easy-to-use functionality for efficiently and conveniently sharing results that aims to create transformative impact across many scientific domains.</r3d:description>
